 "notes": [
  "TITLE WITHHELD: the published title 'COW SHT ON A STICK' is a censored swear ('SHT'; the strategy tells the story of 'a nice big stick with a pile of cow @#$% on it'); the page uses Geoff Gallo-Cornell LS (not yet live).",
  "The Cards section was cut off by DeckTech; the strategy opens 'heres the beginning of the decklist' and gives Starting (6) and Characters (16) plus the two missing Ships (Liberty, R2-D2 in Red 5). Those cards are added from the strategy as named by the poster; RLinR1, Home One, Millenium Falcon and Red Squadron 1 at the top of the Cards section are the other four of 'Ships(6)'. Total 60.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (6)': Hoth: North Ridge, Hoth: Main Power Generators, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Draw Their Fire, Squadron Assignments and Strike Planning; no Objective (an EBO deck), so Hoth: North Ridge (first listed) is set as the starting card; several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'EPP Luke (or jedi luke, if you have him)' is an either/or line: UNKNOWN (Luke With Lightsaber or Luke Skywalker, Jedi Knight).",
  "Posted 'RLinR1' dested Red Leader In Red 1; 'FO Thaneespi' First Officer Thaneespi; 'Comm Evram Lajaie' Commander Evram Lajaie; 'ECC Chewie' Chewie With Blaster Rifle; 'Capt Han' Captain Han Solo; 'EPP Obi' Obi-Wan With Lightsaber; 'EPP Leia' Leia With Blaster Rifle; 'R2-D2 in Red 5' Artoo-Detoo In Red 5; 'A New Secret Base (key card)' A New Secret Base (the parenthetical is a comment, not a (V) mark); Do, Or Do Not is the Dagobah Effect."
